cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite it and the codec it carries.
title: interactor-voice (voice.elf)
type: software
authors:
  - name: K. S. Ernest (iFire) Lee
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-voice
references:
  - type: software
    title: Opus 1.6.1 (vendor/opus, the classic float codec without its neural extensions)
    authors:
      - name: Xiph.Org Foundation and the Opus contributors
    repository-code: https://github.com/xiph/opus
    version: 1.6.1
    license: BSD-3-Clause
    notes: >-
      Copied from the org's engine fork (thirdparty/opus_speech). vendor/opus/COPYING is upstream's
      licence text; vendor/opus/config.h is written here.
  - type: software
    title: godot-speech (modules/speech in V-Sekai-fire/entities-godot)
    authors:
      - name: V-Sekai contributors
      - name: K. S. Ernest (iFire) Lee
      - name: SaracenOne
    repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/entities-godot
    license: MIT
    notes: >-
      The codec settings (48 kHz mono, 20 ms frames, 128 kbit/s, complexity 10, in-band FEC for 10%
      loss) come from its SpeechProcessor.
  - type: software
    title: godot-sandbox guest API (vendor/sandbox-api)
    repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/godot-sandbox
    license: BSD-3-Clause
